From b6a773c60d96ce600ff784db50ebbc3cc5259822 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:34:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] chore(refactor): e2e surface extended
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

analysis/T/e2e-surface.mjs now also lists the reads that bypass a selector
(round.md §1.8.1): getAttribute names, dataset keys (as data-*), class reads
(classList.contains/toggle/add/remove and .className) and child structure
(children, first/lastElementChild, childElementCount, tagName, nodeName),
each with suite:line, and counts them per area in the summary.

e2e-surface.txt is regenerated from it; its earlier sections are unchanged.
Some reads land on the Foundry stand-in's or a chat card's DOM (gmerr,
manualdice, activities:828); the list keeps them so RV3 can tell them apart.
It is what C1 and C4 are checked against.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01821Sr9FKASxJn47SNudpbR
